# Line endings are LF on every platform. This file travels with the module into each
# consumer's vendor/ tree (go mod vendor copies the root package's files), so it must not
# leave the choice to the consumer's core.autocrlf: with autocrlf=true, `text=auto` alone
# checks the vendored files out with CRLF while go mod vendor writes LF, and the files
# show as modified after every go mod vendor.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.go text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf

# Binary files are left untouched
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.pdf binary
